  "chapter": 584,
  "signer": "KATHY HOCHUL",
  "text": " \n                APPROVAL MEMORANDUM - No. 11 Chapter 584\n \n      MEMORANDUM filed with Assembly Bill Number 6332-A, entitled:\n \n    \"AN  ACT to amend the criminal procedure law, in relation to notify-\n        ing certain crime victims of the disposition of criminal trial\"\n \n    APPROVED\n \n  This bill would require District Attorneys to notify  victims  of  the\nresults  of  a prosecution. I agree with the goals of this bill, however\nchanges were needed to allow victims to express  a  preference  for  the\nmanner of notification.\n \n  I have reached an agreement with the Legislature to enact these chang-\nes  in the upcoming legislative session. On the basis of this agreement,\nI am pleased to sign this bill into law.\n \n  This bill is approved.                         (signed) KATHY HOCHUL\n\n                                ______\n",
  "year": 2025
 },
